    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "CONCRETE TRAP, hit during the 2026-08-16 ephemeral-addressing plan: a plan that deletes a rule from the internal method and re-homes it only on the facade makes the CLI WORSE than before, because the CLI loses the rule with nothing replacing it. Ordering matters -- guard the CLI first, then move the internal rule. Also: tests that drive the internal methods (e.g. ScriniaMcpToolsTests.cs:1683 \u0060Append_TempPath_IsEphemeral_WhetherOrNotTheMemoryExists\u0060, which calls the internal \u0060Append\u0060) will go red",
